    "Uff!": ["Det regner igjen.","Uff! Ikke i dag også.","It's raining again. / Ugh! Not today too."],
    "Uff da!": ["Jeg mistet kaffen på gulvet.","Uff da! Jeg henter et papir.","I dropped my coffee on the floor. / Oh dear! I'll get a paper towel."],
    "Huff!": ["Jeg har vondt i hodet.","Huff, stakkars deg.","I have a headache. / Oh no, poor you."],
    "Hæ?": ["Kommer du på fredag?","Hæ? Jeg hørte ikke.","Are you coming on Friday? / Huh? I didn't hear."],
    "Oisann!": ["Oisann! Jeg tok feil jakke.","Det går bra.","Oops! I took the wrong jacket. / That's fine."],
    "Heia!": ["Heia Norge!","Heia!","Go, Norway! / Go!"],
    "Nja.": ["Liker du filmen?","Nja. Den er litt lang.","Do you like the movie? / Well… It's a bit long."],
    "Å nei!": ["Butikken er stengt i dag.","Å nei! Jeg trenger melk.","The shop is closed today. / Oh no! I need milk."],
    "Å ja!": ["Kari er søstera mi.","Å ja! Nå skjønner jeg.","Kari is my sister. / Oh, right! Now I get it."],
